<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm.</font>

45
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino...</font>

46
00:03:20,050 --> 00:03:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm way ahead of you on
Sasuke-kun information.</font>

47
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Missed your chance on that one,
eh, Billboard Brow?</font>

48
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! This is for Lee-san!</font>

49
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

50
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one from before should
be wilted by now too...</font>

51
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh.</font>

52
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-kun! Stop it!</font>

53
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:44,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">191...</font>

54
00:03:45,410 --> 00:03:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't touch me!</font>

55
00:03:46,990 --> 00:03:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... not... done yet...</font>

56
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:51,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

57
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks.</font>

58
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:58,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope Lee-sans's better.</font>

59
00:03:58,710 --> 00:03:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

60
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:23,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

61
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?</font>

62
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh man, it's all clogged up.
What a drag...</font>

63
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo!</font>

64
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You finally woke up, eh?</font>

65
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where... am I?</font>

66
00:04:44,090 --> 00:04:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the hospital!</font>

67
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:48,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They told me that you've been sound
asleep for three days and three nights!</font>

68
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three days...</font>

69
00:04:51,890 --> 00:04:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three days and three nights?!</font>

70
00:04:54,850 --> 00:04:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?</font>

71
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:59,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! When does
the final competition start?</font>

72
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Tomorrow.</font>

73
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

74
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:05,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why didn't you wake me
up earlier!</font>

75
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't be just snoozing through
in a place like this!</font>

76
00:05:09,450 --> 00:05:10,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what about Pervy Sage?</font>

77
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:12,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Pervy Sage?!</font>

78
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:14,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to have him watch
over my training.</font>

79
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What are you talking about,
all of a sudden?</font>

80
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what's got into you.</font>

81
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? My clothes are missing!</font>

82
00:05:22,420 --> 00:05:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are they?
Where, where?</font>

83
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sleeping away like you're in a coma,
— Gone!</font>

84
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— then running around out of control.
— Where're my clothes?!</font>

85
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Settle down a little!</font>

86
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know what?
It isn't gonna make a difference</font>

87
00:05:35,890 --> 00:05:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you rush around
one day beforehand.</font>

88
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Resting is training, too, you know...</font>

89
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hey... Naruto.</font>

90
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world
is going on?</font>

91
00:05:45,610 --> 00:05:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... so... hungry...</font>

92
00:05:47,950 --> 00:05:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't keep scaring me like that...</font>

93
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah.</font>

94
00:05:57,710 --> 00:05:59,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's such a drag but...</font>

95
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:01,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bought this fruit basket as
a get-well present for Choji.</font>

96
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the doctor said he couldn't have it.</font>

97
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So let's eat it together.</font>

98
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji? Is he that sick?</font>

99
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:10,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no, don't be fooled.</font>

100
00:06:10,850 --> 00:06:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got sick from eating
too much BBQ.</font>

101
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just like him!</font>

102
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah well, and neither of you are the type
to have female visitors.</font>

103
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So here...</font>

104
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks good.</font>

105
00:06:29,780 --> 00:06:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is it?</font>

106
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since Choji can't have any,
let's eat in front of him.</font>

107
00:06:36,410 --> 00:06:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a drag this guy is!</font>

108
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

109
00:06:43,290 --> 00:06:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one's here.</font>

110
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out to lunch?</font>

111
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:54,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh well...</font>

112
00:07:03,730 --> 00:07:04,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

113
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

114
00:08:15,010 --> 00:08:18,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san, I'm putting the
flowers here, okay?</font>

115
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm still hungry!</font>

116
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you harassing me, Shikamaru?</font>

117
00:09:11,690 --> 00:09:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah.</font>

118
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... save him?</font>

119
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an important subordinate
who I care for.</font>

120
00:10:48,710 --> 00:10:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body... isn't moving.</font>

121
00:10:51,750 --> 00:10:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk!</font>

122
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell do you think
you're doing?!</font>

123
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto...</font>

124
00:11:02,850 --> 00:11:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During Shadow Possession Jutsu,
it's moving me too! Okay?!</font>

125
00:11:08,890 --> 00:11:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry! Shikamaru.</font>

126
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell were you
trying to do?</font>

127
00:11:20,950 --> 00:11:23,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, are you better?</font>

128
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:24,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Ino!</font>

129
00:11:30,210 --> 00:11:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! The age of
the chubby has arrived!</font>

130
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What were you trying to do
to Bushy Brow here?!</font>

131
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was trying to kill him.</font>

132
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

133
00:11:54,190 --> 00:11:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can he be so calm?</font>

134
00:11:56,900 --> 00:12:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially when he is not able to
move with my Shadow Possession Jutsu...</font>

135
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd you have to do something
like that?</font>

136
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You beat him in the match, right?</font>

137
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:11,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have a personal grudge
against him or something?</font>

138
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:13,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have anything like that.</font>

139
00:12:15,380 --> 00:12:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just wanted to kill him, that's it.</font>

140
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you say something
so selfish, you bastard?!</font>

141
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... you had a lousy upbringing,
didn't you?</font>

142
00:12:25,970 --> 00:12:27,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All you care about is yourself.</font>

143
00:12:28,850 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or there's something weird about him.
It gives me the chills!</font>

144
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he tries anything, it'll be too much
of a burden for me and Naruto...</font>

145
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell should we do?</font>

146
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:44,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you get in my way,
I'll kill you both too.</font>

147
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Go ahead, if you can!</font>

148
00:12:47,450 --> 00:12:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Naruto, hold on!</font>

149
00:12:50,620 --> 00:12:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I try to scare him with a bluff?</font>

150
00:12:54,420 --> 00:12:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know you're strong from seeing you
in the competition with him...</font>

151
00:12:58,290 --> 00:13:02,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... we can keep up with you.</font>

152
00:13:03,470 --> 00:13:07,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't show you our best skills
in the preliminaries.</font>

153
00:13:07,850 --> 00:13:09,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's two against one!</font>

154
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:11,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one who's at a disadvantage.</font>

155
00:13:11,850 --> 00:13:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're smart, you'll do what
I tell you and just get lost.</font>

156
00:13:16,770 --> 00:13:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll say it again...
if you get in my way...</font>

157
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill you.</font>

158
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where the hell do you get off...?!</font>

159
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way in hell
I'll let you do that!</font>

160
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been telling you
to back off, haven't I?</font>

161
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy has the strength of a monster.
You get it, don't you?</font>

162
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a real monster in me!
I'm not going to lose to this guy!</font>

163
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

164
00:13:51,970 --> 00:13:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard Naruto was here too,
so I came to see, but...</font>

165
00:13:55,770 --> 00:13:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a mess...</font>

166
00:13:59,190 --> 00:14:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess this means he's okay.</font>

167
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

168
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's worth making him mad,
you idiot!</font>

169
00:14:15,870 --> 00:14:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A monster, huh...?</font>

170
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too, actually.</font>

171
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like you said.
I had a terrible upbringing.</font>

172
00:14:28,470 --> 00:14:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I came into this world,</font>

173
00:14:29,930 --> 00:14:32,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I took the life of the woman
some might call my mother.</font>

174
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:35,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that I could become
the strongest Shinobi...</font>

175
00:14:35,810 --> 00:14:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my father brought his
Ninjutsu upon me,</font>

176
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and so I became possessed
by a Sand Spirit.</font>

177
00:14:41,690 --> 00:14:43,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was born a monster.</font>

178
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:47,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Sand Spirit?</font>

179
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called Shukaku, the living wraith of
an old monk</font>

180
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from Village Hidden in the Sand
who was sealed inside the tea cauldron.</font>

181
00:14:57,580 --> 00:14:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must be a type of
cacodemon possession Jutsu,</font>

182
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">performed to a baby before it is born.</font>

183
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To go that far...
they must have been totally nuts.</font>

184
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:12,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it possible... that there could be
something inside him too?</font>

185
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a thing for a parent to be doing!
Such a twisted kind of love.</font>

186
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love?</font>

187
00:15:22,810 --> 00:15:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't measure me by your standards.</font>

188
00:15:27,650 --> 00:15:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Family, huh...</font>

189
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me tell you what kind of ties
I have to my family.</font>

190
00:15:33,990 --> 00:15:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're ties of hatred,
ties of murderous intent...</font>

191
00:15:36,740 --> 00:15:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My family's just lumps of flesh.</font>

192
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nourished with the life of my mother,</font>

193
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:46,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was crafted as the
ultimate masterpiece of the village...</font>

194
00:15:47,250 --> 00:15:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kazekage's child.</font>

195
00:15:49,970 --> 00:15:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was taught by my father
the innermost secrets of the Shinobi...</font>

196
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">spoiled, over-protected,
and left on my own.</font>

197
00:15:57,680 --> 00:16:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I thought that was love...</font>

198
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until that incident happened.</font>

199
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That incident...?!</font>

200
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?</font>

201
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what happened?!</font>

202
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the six years since the time
when I was 6 years old...</font>

203
00:16:28,170 --> 00:16:31,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My real father has tried to assassinate me
more times than I can count!</font>

204
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:38,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I thought you just said that
your father spoiled you...</font>

205
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on here?</font>

206
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who are too strong are
apt to become feared.</font>

207
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Born through the Jutsu,
my mind was unstable...</font>

208
00:16:55,570 --> 00:16:57,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess the idiots in my village</font>

209
00:16:57,570 --> 00:17:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">finally realized that
I had emotional problems...</font>

210
00:17:01,790 --> 00:17:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For my father, Kazekage,</font>

211
00:17:03,830 --> 00:17:06,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the same time I was
the ultimate weapon for the village,</font>

212
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was also a dangerous,
fearsome presence.</font>

213
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:15,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems I was labeled a dangerous figure
as soon as I turned six.</font>

214
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:20,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I was treated politely simply because
I was feared.</font>

215
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To them, now I'm just a relic of the past
that they want to see disappear.</font>

216
00:17:26,350 --> 00:17:30,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what did I have in this life,
why did I keep living?</font>

217
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I asked myself that,
I couldn't find the answer.</font>

218
00:17:34,990 --> 00:17:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, as long as you're alive,
you need a reason...</font>

219
00:17:39,870 --> 00:17:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't have one,
it's just the same as being dead.</font>

220
00:17:42,290 --> 00:17:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this guy saying?</font>

221
00:17:47,250 --> 00:17:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... can understand that...</font>

222
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He... is the same as me.</font>

223
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the answer I came to...</font>

224
00:17:57,930 --> 00:18:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am living in order to kill
human beings other than myself.</font>

225
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:05,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After living in the fear of never knowing
when I might be murdered,</font>

226
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">finally I became calm.</font>

227
00:18:09,060 --> 00:18:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By killing assassins, I finally
comprehended the reason why I live...</font>

228
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:20,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I live fighting for only myself
and loving myself...</font>

229
00:18:20,910 --> 00:18:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if I see that all other people
in this world exist</font>

230
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only to make me realize that,</font>

231
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there could be no world
more wonderful.</font>

232
00:18:29,210 --> 00:18:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as long as there are
others to kill</font>

233
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who can make me feel
this happiness to be alive,</font>

234
00:18:38,090 --> 00:18:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will never disappear.</font>

235
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's this freak talking about...?</font>

236
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's real gone!</font>

237
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was also alone...</font>

238
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And suffered 'cause
I didn't know why I was alive...</font>

239
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Iruka-sensei recognized me
for who I was...</font>

240
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:58,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and that was the first time
I realized why I lived...</font>

241
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this guy...
this guy grew up alone.</font>

242
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he only feels alive
when he kills other people.</font>

243
00:19:12,170 --> 00:19:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-How can there be someone like this?</font>

244
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The worlds we live in
are too different...!</font>

245
00:19:24,890 --> 00:19:28,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way...
that I can beat a guy like this!</font>

246
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's wrong, Naruto?</font>

247
00:19:40,650 --> 00:19:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Shadow Possession Jutsu should
have stopped him from moving, but...</font>

248
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

249
00:19:52,870 --> 00:19:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Hey, get yourself together!</font>

250
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a drag this guy is!</font>

251
00:19:56,710 --> 00:19:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

252
00:19:58,210 --> 00:20:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let me feel it...!</font>

253
00:20:03,010 --> 00:20:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

254
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop right there!</font>

255
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow's the final round!</font>

256
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to rush like this!</font>

257
00:20:11,140 --> 00:20:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or do you just want to
stay here starting today?</font>

258
00:20:15,650 --> 00:20:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't leave me alone!</font>

259
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not bleeding, but
it hurts a lot right here.</font>

260
00:20:24,660 --> 00:20:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... am I?!</font>

261
00:20:51,930 --> 00:20:55,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will... kill you all without a fail.</font>

262
00:20:56,230 --> 00:20:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait.</font>

